    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Build. Innovate. Compete. Win.</p>\n<p><strong>Rule 1 &ndash; Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Open to students and working professionals residing in India.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Individual participants and teams are permitted.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Recommended team size: 1&ndash;4 members.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participants must provide accurate registration information.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Employees, organizers and judges should not compete in categories where they have a conflict of interest.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rule 2 &ndash; Competition Tracks</strong></p>\n<p>Participants may submit projects under any of the six official tracks:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>AI &amp; Agentic AI.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>HR Tech &amp; Recruitment.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Enterprise SaaS.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Data &amp; Analytics.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Cloud &amp; DevOps.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Cybersecurity &amp; Digital Trust.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rule 3 &ndash; Project Requirements</strong></p>\n<p>Every project must include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>A clear problem statement.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>A proposed solution.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Working prototype or demonstrable implementation.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Technology stack.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Architecture overview.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>GitHub repository or equivalent source-code access for evaluation.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Demo video or live demonstration.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Explanation of real-world business value.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rule 4 &ndash; Originality</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Projects must be original or appropriately licensed.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Previously developed components must be disclosed.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>AI-generated code and third-party tools are allowed if disclosed.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Plagiarism, impersonation and unauthorized code reuse are prohibited.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participants must have permission to use all datasets and APIs.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rule 5 &ndash; Submission</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Submissions must be made through the official portal.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Late submissions may be rejected.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Incomplete submissions may be disqualified.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Teams must identify all members and their respective contributions.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
